sequenceDiagram
    participant A as App or backend
    participant S as Shadow HTTP API
    participant D as MQTT device
    A->>S: SigV4 POST /things/device-1/shadow?name=tutorial<br/>JSON desired patch
    alt Authentication and update succeed
        S->>S: Commit state and notification event
        par HTTP response
            S-->>A: HTTP 200 accepted patch
        and Asynchronous notification
            S-->>D: MQTT shadow update/delta
        end
    else Request rejected
        S-->>A: HTTP error and JSON error document
    end
    Note over A,D: HTTP success does not confirm device execution
